~A. The topic is peace, so the purpose is peace.#This confuses topic with purpose. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
~B. The central idea is justice, so the purpose is justice.#This is incomplete. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
